        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "45103c1f-cdac-5bb0-b712-28a4c2727931",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roddy Maude-Roxby, Tom McGowan, Tom Rowe, Clint Eastwood\n- Films: The Aristocats, Unconditional Love, White Hunter Black Heart\n- Companies: Walt Disney\n- Characters: Edgar Balthazar, Thompson\n- Topics: Disney animated feature films\n\nFacts:\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby was born on 2 April 1930 in London and is an English actor.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby appeared as Edgar Balthazar in Walt Disney's film The Aristocats.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby also appeared in the films Unconditional Love and White Hunter Black Heart, in which he played Thompson.\n- The Aristocats is the 20th Disney animated feature film.\n- The Aristocats is based on a story by Tom McGowan and Tom Rowe.\n- The Aristocats revolves around a family of aristocratic cats who are helped by an alley cat after a butler kidnaps them to gain the fortune their mistress intended for them.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
